{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37635","headline":"入阁 · 郑谷","name":"入阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秘殿临轩日，和銮返正年。\n两班文武盛，百辟羽仪全。\n霜漏清中禁，风旗拂曙天。\n门严新勘契，仗入乍承宣。\n玉几当红旭，金鑪纵碧烟。\n对扬称法吏，赞引出宫钿。\n言动挥毫疾，雍容执簿专。\n寿山晴靉靆，颢气暖连延。\n礼有鸳鸾集，恩无雨露偏。\n小臣叨备位，歌咏泰阶前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}